<BaseLayout title="About Alan Yeong | Asia Market and Consumer Intelligence" description="Discover Alan Yeong’s multidisciplinary perspective across market research, banking, marketing, commercial leadership, consulting and practical AI."><header class="page-hero"><div class="wrap narrow"><p class="eyebrow">About Alan</p><h1>A perspective built across disciplines</h1><p class="lead">I connect market evidence, consumer realities and commercial priorities to help leaders reach clearer decisions across Asia.</p></div></header><div class="page-body wrap narrow prose"><h2>Experience beyond a single discipline</h2><p>Market research taught me to investigate questions systematically. Consumer intelligence taught me to look beneath reported behaviour. Banking, marketing and commercial leadership taught me to connect insight with operational and financial realities. Consulting taught me to provide direction when the answer is not obvious.</p><h2>How I work</h2><p>I begin with the decision—not a predetermined methodology. The work then identifies the evidence, context, assumptions and practical constraints that matter most.</p><h2>Human judgement in an AI-enabled world</h2><p>AI can strengthen exploration, synthesis and productivity. Accountability, cultural understanding and experienced judgement remain human responsibilities.</p><a class="button" href="/contact/">Discuss a professional enquiry</a></div></BaseLayout>
